Sirup

&lt;a href="Sirup"&gt;Sirup&lt;/a&gt; (saka &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; شراب sharab, ombènan) ya iku &lt;a href="cuw%C3%A8ran"&gt;cuwèran&lt;/a&gt; kang &lt;a href="kenthel"&gt;kenthel&lt;/a&gt; lan duwé kadhar &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="larutan"&gt;kalarut&lt;/a&gt; kang dhuwur, nanging ora duwé endhepan &lt;a href="kristal"&gt;kristal&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Viskositas"&gt;Viskositas&lt;/a&gt; (kakenthelan) sirup disebabaké amarga akèhé &lt;a href="ikatan%20hidrogen"&gt;ikatan hidrogen&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="gugus%20fungsional"&gt;gugus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="hidroksil"&gt;hidroksil&lt;/a&gt; (OH) ing &lt;a href="molekul"&gt;molekul&lt;/a&gt; gula kang larut ing molekul &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt;. Miturut &lt;a href="t%C3%A8knik"&gt;tèknik&lt;/a&gt; utawa ing &lt;a href="sains"&gt;èlmiah&lt;/a&gt;, istilah sirup uga kerep minangka nyebutaké cuwèran kenthel, lumrahé &lt;a href="r%C3%A9sidhu"&gt;résidhu&lt;/a&gt;, kang ngandhut dat saliyané gula.
Kanggo ngundhakaké &lt;a href="kons%C3%A8ntrasi"&gt;kadhar&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; kang larut, lumrahé sirup dipanasaké. Larutan sirup dadi &lt;a href="super-jenuh"&gt;super-jenuh&lt;/a&gt;.
Sirup uga kerep minangka &lt;a href="usada"&gt;usada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kulin%C3%A8r"&gt;kulinèr&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="omb%C3%A8nan"&gt;ombènan&lt;/a&gt;. Sirup lumrahé digawé saka gula lan banyu. Sirup ngandhut gula kurang luwih &lt;a href="50"&gt;50&lt;/a&gt;%-&lt;a href="80"&gt;80&lt;/a&gt;%.
Sirup wujudé kenthel. Nalika ngombé sirup kudu dicampur karo banyu. Sirup lumrahé diombé karo &lt;a href="%C3%A8s%20watu"&gt;ès watu&lt;/a&gt;, nanging sirup uga kena diombé karo banyu anget. Sirup digawé kanthi manéka rasa. Lumrahé rasa &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt;-wohan kaya ta &lt;a href="jeruk"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="stroberi"&gt;stroberi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="klapa"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pandhan"&gt;pandhan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="apel"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="bl%C3%A9wah"&gt;bléwah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kiwi"&gt;kiwi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="t%C3%A9rong%20landa"&gt;térong landa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="dlima"&gt;dlima&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="arbey"&gt;arbey&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku sirup uga ana kang digawé saka campuran rasa woh-wohan mau kaya ta jeruk karo bléwah, klapa-pandhan.
Sirup lumrahé diwadhahi &lt;a href="gendul"&gt;gendul&lt;/a&gt; lan didol ing &lt;a href="toko"&gt;toko&lt;/a&gt;-toko. Ana uga obat sirup, obat iki banjur digawé sirup dhéwé kanthi digodhog karo gula lan banyu. Sirup kang didol lumrahé duwé mèrek. Mèrek-mèrek sirup ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="Sirup%20ABC"&gt;Sirup ABC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sirup%20Marjan"&gt;Sirup Marjan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indofood"&gt;Indofood&lt;/a&gt; lan liya-liyané. Kajaba iku sirup uga ana kang wis diwadhahi ing gelas-gelas lan didol kanthi di press tutupé.
