<doc id="75200" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=75200" title="Pudhing">
Pudhing

Pudhing ya iku jeneng kanggo warna-warna &lt;a href="hidhangan%20panutup"&gt;hidhangan panutup&lt;/a&gt; kang lumrahé digawé saka bahan-bahan kang digodhog, dikukus, utawa dipanggang. Istilah pudhing uga dianggo ing warna-warna jinis &lt;a href="pai"&gt;pai&lt;/a&gt; kang isiné &lt;a href="lemak"&gt;lemak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="k%C3%A9wan"&gt;kéwan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt;-wohan kang dipanggang.
Pudhing kang bahan dhasaré &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="yogurt"&gt;yogurt&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="glepung%20maiz%C3%A9na"&gt;glepung maizéna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="glepung%20tapioka"&gt;tapioka&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; kang dipangan kanthi diademaké dhisik. Pudhing kaya ngéné iki rasané legi kanthi bahan campuran kaya ta &lt;a href="coklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="karam%C3%A9l"&gt;karamél&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="vanila"&gt;vanila&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="woh-wohan"&gt;woh-wohan&lt;/a&gt;. Pudhing &lt;a href="ager-ager"&gt;ager-ager&lt;/a&gt; digawé kanthi myampuraké ager-ager karo &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="maizena"&gt;maizena&lt;/a&gt;, utawa endhog kang dikocok. Pudhing ager-ager kerep dipangan karo &lt;a href="saos"&gt;saos&lt;/a&gt;. Saos pudhing iki diarani &lt;a href="vla"&gt;vla&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Tepung%20puding%20instan"&gt;Tepung puding instan&lt;/a&gt; luwih gampang nalika digawé pudhing awit mung dicampur karo susu utawa &lt;a href="banyu"&gt;banyu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="panas"&gt;panas&lt;/a&gt; lan dijarké nganti adhem lan kenyal.
Ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; ana warna-warna pudhing kang rasané tradhisional. Pudhing iki lumrahé nggunakaké &lt;a href="klapa"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt; nom, &lt;a href="gula%20abang"&gt;gula abang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tap%C3%A8"&gt;tapè&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ketang%20ireng"&gt;ketang ireng&lt;/a&gt;, utawa campuran &lt;a href="godhong%20suji"&gt;godhong suji&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="godhong%20pandhan"&gt;godhong pandhan&lt;/a&gt;. Woh-wohan kang dianggo nggawé pudhing kaya ta &lt;a href="jeruk"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="nanas"&gt;nanas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sirsak"&gt;sirsak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mangga"&gt;mangga&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="markisa"&gt;markisa&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Asal-usul</h2>
Asal-usul.
Pudhing asalé saka &lt;a href="basa%20Perancis"&gt;basa Perancis&lt;/a&gt;, boudin kang tegesé "&lt;a href="sosis%20darah"&gt;sosis darah&lt;/a&gt;", saka &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt;, botellus kang tegesé "sosis cilik". Istilah pudding digunakaké Èropa abad pertengahan kanggo jinis hidhangan kang digawé saka &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; kang dibungkus.
Ora kabéh pudhing rasané legi. Kaya ta suet pudding (puding lemak) ya iku jinis pudhing kang isiné daging sapi kang dibungkus adonan &lt;a href="pai"&gt;pai&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="trigu"&gt;trigu&lt;/a&gt; kang dicampur lemak &lt;a href="wedhus%20gibas"&gt;wedhus gibas&lt;/a&gt; utawa lemak &lt;a href="sapi"&gt;sapi&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;, istilah pudding kerep kanggo hidhangan panutup kang digawé saka endhog lan glepung kang dimasak kanthi cara dikukus, digodhog utawa dipanggang.
