<doc id="75346" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=75346" title="Kimono">
Kimono

Kimono (着物, Kimono) yaiku &lt;a href="sandhangan"&gt;sandhangan&lt;/a&gt; tradhisional &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;. Kimono tegesé &lt;a href="klambi"&gt;klambi&lt;/a&gt; utawa barang kang dianggo (ki tegesé anggo, lan mono tegesé barang).
Jaman saiki, kimono dhapuré kaya huruf "&lt;a href="T"&gt;T&lt;/a&gt;", mirib &lt;a href="mantel"&gt;mantel&lt;/a&gt; kang lengené dawa lan ana krahé. Dawané kimono digawé nganti ing sikil pérangan ngisor. Wong wadon kang nganggo kimono dhapuré klambiné yaiku klambi terusan, nanging wong &lt;a href="lanang"&gt;lanang&lt;/a&gt; nggunakaké kimono kang dhapuré stelan. Krah pérangan &lt;a href="tengen"&gt;tengen&lt;/a&gt; kuduné ana ing ngisor &lt;a href="krah"&gt;krah&lt;/a&gt; pérangan tengen. &lt;a href="Sabuk"&gt;Sabuk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kain"&gt;kain&lt;/a&gt; kang diarani &lt;a href="obi%20%28sabuk%29"&gt;obi&lt;/a&gt; dianggo ing pérangan &lt;a href="weteng"&gt;weteng&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="bangk%C3%A9kan"&gt;bangkékan&lt;/a&gt; lan ditaléni ing pérangan &lt;a href="geger"&gt;geger&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika nganggo kimono uga kudu nganggo &lt;a href="z%C5%8Dri"&gt;zōri&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="geta"&gt;geta&lt;/a&gt; kanggo nutup tlapakan &lt;a href="sikil"&gt;sikil&lt;/a&gt;.
Kimono saiki luwih kerep dianggo wong &lt;a href="w%C3%A9dok"&gt;wédok&lt;/a&gt;. Kimono dianggo nalika ana acara-acara kang mirunggan. Wong &lt;a href="wadon"&gt;wadon&lt;/a&gt; kang durung &lt;a href="kawin"&gt;kawin&lt;/a&gt; nganggo kimono kang diarani &lt;a href="furisode"&gt;furisode&lt;/a&gt;. Ciri khas furisode yaiku lengené kang amba meh tekan ngisor. Wong wadon kang umuré wis &lt;a href="20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; nganggo furisode kanggo nekani &lt;a href="seijin%20shiki"&gt;seijin shiki&lt;/a&gt;. Wong lanang nganggo kimono ing &lt;a href="riyaya"&gt;riyaya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="ngant%C3%A9nan"&gt;nganténan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="upacara"&gt;upacara&lt;/a&gt; ngombé &lt;a href="teh"&gt;teh&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing &lt;a href="acara"&gt;acara&lt;/a&gt;] formal liyané. Nalika ing njaba panggonan &lt;a href="sumo"&gt;sumo&lt;/a&gt;, pesumo kang profésional kudu nganggo kimono. Bocah-&lt;a href="bocah"&gt;bocah&lt;/a&gt; nganggo kimono nalika nekani acara karaméan &lt;a href="Shichi-Go-San"&gt;Shichi-Go-San&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku kimono uga dianggo wong kang kerja ing babagan &lt;a href="indhustri"&gt;indhustri&lt;/a&gt; jasa lan &lt;a href="pariwisata"&gt;pariwisata&lt;/a&gt;, pelayan wadon ing rumah makan &lt;a href="tradhisional"&gt;tradhisional&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="ry%C5%8Dtei"&gt;ryōtei&lt;/a&gt;) lan pegawé &lt;a href="panginepan"&gt;panginepan&lt;/a&gt; tradhisional (&lt;a href="ryokan"&gt;ryokan&lt;/a&gt;).
<h2>Aksésori lan pelengkap</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Hakama"&gt;Hakama&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Hakama yaiku &lt;a href="clana"&gt;clana&lt;/a&gt; dawa wong lanang kang digawé saka bahan kang wernané peteng. Clana jinis iki asalé saka daratan &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Cina&lt;/a&gt; lan wiwit dikenal wiwit &lt;a href="jaman%20Asuka"&gt;jaman Asuka&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané dianggo &lt;a href="pandhita"&gt;pandhita&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Shinto"&gt;Shinto&lt;/a&gt;, hakama uga dianggo wong lanang lan wong wadon ing babagan &lt;a href="ulah%20raga"&gt;ulah raga&lt;/a&gt; bela diri kaya ta &lt;a href="kendo"&gt;kendo&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="kyudo"&gt;kyudo&lt;/a&gt;.
<li>&lt;a href="Geta%20%28alas%20kaki%29"&gt;Geta&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Geta yaiku &lt;a href="sandhal"&gt;sandhal&lt;/a&gt; kang ana haké. Sandal iki digawé saka kayu. &lt;a href="Maiko"&gt;Maiko&lt;/a&gt; nganggo geta kang hake dhuwur lan kandel kang diarani pokkuri.
<li>&lt;a href="Kanzashi"&gt;Kanzashi&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Kanzashi yaiku rerenggan &lt;a href="rambut"&gt;rambut&lt;/a&gt; kang dhapuré kaya tusuk &lt;a href="konde"&gt;konde&lt;/a&gt; kang dianggo ing rambut nalika nganggo kimono.
<li>&lt;a href="Obi%20%28sabuk%29"&gt;Obi&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Obi yaiku &lt;a href="sabuk"&gt;sabuk&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="kain"&gt;kain&lt;/a&gt; kang dililitaké ing &lt;a href="awak"&gt;awak&lt;/a&gt; kanggo ngencengaké kimomo.
<li>&lt;a href="Tabi"&gt;Tabi&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Tabiyaiku &lt;a href="kaos%20kaki"&gt;kaos kaki&lt;/a&gt; dawané nganti tekan betis. Kaos kaki iki dianggo nalika nganggo sandhal.
<li>&lt;a href="Waraji"&gt;Waraji&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Waraji yaiku sandhal kang digawé saka &lt;a href="anyaman"&gt;anyaman&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tali"&gt;tali&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="dami"&gt;dami&lt;/a&gt;.
<li>&lt;a href="Z%C5%8Dri"&gt;Zōri&lt;/a&gt;</li>
Zōri yaiku sandhal tradhisional kang digawé saka kain utawa anyaman.
</ul>
