anggotané Muse ya iku &lt;a href="Matthew%20Bellamy"&gt;Matthew Bellamy&lt;/a&gt; (vokalis, gitaris, pianis), &lt;a href="Dominic%20Howard"&gt;Dominic Howard&lt;/a&gt; (drummer), lan &lt;a href="Chris%20Wolstenholme"&gt;Chris Wolstenholme&lt;/a&gt; (bassis).
