<li>&lt;a href="Dalan%20Tol%20Cipularang"&gt;Dalan tol Cipularang&lt;/a&gt; kang nyambungaké kutha &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; lan kutha &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
