<doc id="75540" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=75540" title="Sami Khedira">
Sami Khedira

Sami Khedira (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: سامي خضيرة‎‎; #ALIH) inggih punika juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; saking &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Khedira dipunlairaken saking ibu katurunan Jerman lan rama keturunan &lt;a href="Tunisia"&gt;Tunisia&lt;/a&gt;. Sapunika Sami Khedira main ing tim nasional Jerman lan klub saking &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Real%20Madrid"&gt;Real Madrid&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier klub</h2>
<h3>vfb Stuttgart</h3>
Karier klub.
vfb Stuttgart.
Khedira lair ing Stuttgart, saking rama ingkang asalipun saking Tunisia lan ibu saking Jerman. Saderengipun main ing tim junior &lt;a href="vfb%20Stuttgart"&gt;vfb Stuttgart&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1995, Khedira main ing klub &lt;a href="TV%20Oeffingen"&gt;TV Oeffingen&lt;/a&gt;. Ing purwanipun mangsa 2006-2007, Khedira dipunpundhut déning klub &lt;a href="vfb%20Stuttgart"&gt;vfb Stuttgart&lt;/a&gt; ingkang samika samanten dipunmanageri déning &lt;a href="Armin%20Veh"&gt;Armin Veh&lt;/a&gt;. Debut ingkang pisanan dipunlaksanakaken sasi &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
<h3>Real Madrid</h3>
Real Madrid.
Nalika tanggal 30 Juli 2010, Sami Khedira pindah dhateng klub &lt;a href="Real%20Madrid"&gt;Real Madrid&lt;/a&gt; kanthi status bébas transfer. Khedira gadhah nomer 24. Khedira miwiti debut ing Real Madrid nalika tanggal 13 Agustus 2010 nalika tandhing persahabatan kaliyan &lt;a href="Bayern%20Munich"&gt;Bayern Munich&lt;/a&gt;, nalika samanten Real Madrid menang 4-2 kanthi adu penalti. Ing tim Real Madrid, Sami Khedira pikantuk Piala the Franz-Beckenbauer-Cup. Debutipun ing Liga Spanyol dipunwiwiti tanggal &lt;a href="29%20Agustus"&gt;29 Agustus&lt;/a&gt;, nalika Real Madrid mungsuh &lt;a href="Mallorca"&gt;Mallorca&lt;/a&gt;. Tanggal 20 April 2011, Khedira pikantuk tropi Copa del Rey Spanyol, kanthi ngelukaken &lt;a href="FC%20Barcelona"&gt;FC Barcelona&lt;/a&gt;.
