Dracula (novel)

Dracula ya iku &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; ngenani sawijining &lt;a href="bangsawan"&gt;bangsawan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="vampir"&gt;vampir&lt;/a&gt; kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Drakula"&gt;Count Dracula&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="karya"&gt;karya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="penulis"&gt;penulis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Irlandia"&gt;Irlandia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bram%20Stoker"&gt;Bram Stoker&lt;/a&gt;.
Novèl iki minangka novèl kaping lima saka sang penulis lan dipublikasikake kawiwitan déning Archibald Constable lan Company of Westminster. Ing &lt;a href="Basa%20Indonesia"&gt;Basa Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; kerep dilafalake Drakula ngrujuk marang &lt;a href="Count%20Dracula"&gt;Count Dracula&lt;/a&gt; minangka &lt;a href="vampir"&gt;vampir&lt;/a&gt; kang ngisep &lt;a href="getih"&gt;getih&lt;/a&gt;.
Novèl iki wujudé kumpulan dhokumèn-dhokumèn kanthi tokoh-tokoh kaya ta Diari Jonathan Harker utawa Surat Wilhemina Murray marang Lucy Westerna. Dracula bisa digolongake minangka &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="horror"&gt;horror&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="gothic"&gt;gothic&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Carita</h2>
Carita.
&lt;a href="Drakula"&gt;Count Dracula&lt;/a&gt; ya iku sawijining &lt;a href="bangsawan"&gt;bangsawan&lt;/a&gt; kang ngundang &lt;a href="Jonathan%20Harker"&gt;Jonathan Harker&lt;/a&gt; supaya ngurus ngalihe menyang Inggris. Pungkasane &lt;a href="Jonathan%20Harker"&gt;Jonathan Harker&lt;/a&gt; bisa ngéndho amarga jebule &lt;a href="Count%20Dracula"&gt;Count Dracula&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="vampir"&gt;vampir&lt;/a&gt; kang ngisep &lt;a href="getih"&gt;getih&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Drakula"&gt;Count Draculapun&lt;/a&gt; banjur wiwit ngancam tunangan Harker, &lt;a href="Wilhemina%20Murray"&gt;Wilhemina Murray&lt;/a&gt; lan kancane &lt;a href="Lucy%20Westerna"&gt;Lucy Westerna&lt;/a&gt;. Pungkasane Lucy dadi vampire kang ngisep getih. &lt;a href="Dr.%20John%20Seward"&gt;Dr. John Seward&lt;/a&gt;, salah sawijining wong kang gandrung Lucy jaluk tulung marang gurune &lt;a href="Profesor"&gt;Profesor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Abraham%20Van%20Helsing"&gt;Abraham Van Helsing&lt;/a&gt;. Kanthi tetulung mau kabèh mau, Count Dracula bisa dibasmi.
<h2>Latar Belakang</h2>
Latar Belakang.
&lt;a href="Karier"&gt;Karier&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="penulis"&gt;penulis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bram%20Stoker"&gt;Bram Stoker&lt;/a&gt; diwiwiti taun 1876 ya iku nalika dhèwèké nulis ngenani sawijining aktor misuwur ing jaman iku, &lt;a href="Sir%20Henry%20Irving"&gt;Sir Henry Irving&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé maca tulisan &lt;a href="Bram%20Stoker"&gt;Bram Stoker&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sir%20Henry%20Irving"&gt;Sir Henry Irving&lt;/a&gt; ngundhang dhèwèké saperlu mangan bengi kang miwiti kkancane wong-wong mau. Sawisé padha ketemu, uripé &lt;a href="Bram%20Stoker"&gt;Bram Stoker&lt;/a&gt; selawase dadi malih. Rong taun candhaké &lt;a href="Sir%20Henry%20Irving"&gt;Sir Henry Irving&lt;/a&gt; njaluk Lyceum Theatre lan gawé &lt;a href="Bram%20Stoker"&gt;Bram Stoker&lt;/a&gt; manajere ing &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;.
