<doc id="75623" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=75623" title="Marshanda">
Marshanda

Andriani Marshanda jeneng undhang-undhangané "Caca" utawa "Chacha" (#ALIH) iku salah sijining &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt;, bintang &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt;, bintang iklan, &lt;a href="penyanyi"&gt;penyanyi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt;, Dhèwèké kondhang amarga mbintangi Lala ning &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="BIDADARI"&gt;BIDADARI&lt;/a&gt;, karo &lt;a href="Marini%20Zumarnis"&gt;Marini Zumarnis&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi ibu periné.
Kenya ayu kang sok disapa Chacha iki ngakiri masa lajangé lan nikahi &lt;a href="Ben%20Kasyafani"&gt;Ben Kasyafani&lt;/a&gt;, priya kang dipacarai déning Chacha
nganti suwené telung taun dipacari ning dina &lt;a href="Setu"&gt;Setu&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal 2 April 2011 tabuh 11.25, ning Hotèl Sofyan Betawi, &lt;a href="Menteng"&gt;Menteng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;.
Chacha wiwit kariré ning dunya panglipur, awit kelas 1 SD, ora disengaja nalika ngancani &lt;a href="Chintya%20Rustam"&gt;Chintya Rustam&lt;/a&gt; (mantan modhèl iklan sabun)
lunga marang biro iklan &lt;a href="Citra%20Lintas.%26lt%3Bref%20name%3D%26quot%3Bchacha%26quot%3B/%26gt%3B%0ANganti%20dijaluki%20casting%20kanggo%20mbintangi%20iklan%20%5B%5BBank%20Danamon%5D%5D.%26lt%3Bref%20name%3D%26quot%3Bchacha%26quot%3B/%26gt%3B%0ASawis%C3%A9%20iku%20dh%C3%A8w%C3%A8k%C3%A9%20mbintangi%20Filma%2C%20Cadbury%20Eclairs%2C%20Supermi%20Ayam%20Bawang%2C%20Es%20Mony%2C%20Tango%20Wafer%2C%20Chicken%20Nuggets%2C%0ACarvil%20Millenium%2C%20lan%20Susu%20Bendera.%26lt%3Bref%20name%3D%26quot%3Bchacha%26quot%3B/%26gt%3B%0A%0AKanggo%20urusan%20kademis%2C%20Marshanda%20olih%20penghargaan%20%27The%20Most%20Brilliant%20Person%27%20ning%20%5B%5BAsian%20Award%202004%5D%5D%0Aning%20dina%20%5B%5BPendidikan%20Nasional%5D%5D%203%20M%C3%A8i%202004%2C%20lan%20dadi%20Duta%20Lingkungan%20Hidup%20nalika%20taun%202006.%26lt%3Bref%20name%3D%26quot%3Bchacha%26quot%3B/%26gt%3B%0A%0AKenya%20ayu%20iki%20putri%20sulung%20saka%20pasangan%20%5B%5BIrwan%20Yusuf%5D%5D%20lan%20%5B%5BRiyanti%20Sofyan%5D%5D%20iki%20ora%20namung%20bisa%20akting%2C%20dh%C3%A8w%C3%A8k%C3%A9%20uga%20bisa%0Anyanyi%2C%20dh%C3%A8w%C3%A8k%C3%A9%20ngelibatak%C3%A9%20ning%20album%20kompilasi%2C%20kaya%20album%20religi%20%5B%5BALLAH%20YANG%20KUCINTA%5D%5D%20taun%202002%2C%20%5B%5BBEST%20OF%20FEMALE%20IDOL%5D%5D%0A%2C%20%5B%5BBROKEN%20HEART%5D%5D%2C%20%7B%7BNOW%20AND%20FOREVER"&gt;Citra Lintas.
