Adurungé mèlu ning &lt;a href="The%20Virgin"&gt;The Virgin&lt;/a&gt;, Mitha kang penampilané koyo wong lanang iki salah sijiné anggota saka &lt;a href="The%20Rock%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;The Rock Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;,
