Chico Jericho Jarumillind utawa kang biyasa diundang Chico Jericho (#ALIH) ya iku juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Chico wiwit dikenal nalika main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Cinta%20Bunga"&gt;Cinta Bunga&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Chico uga tau main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé &lt;a href="Lawang%20Sewu%20%28filem%29"&gt;Lawang Sewu&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="In%20the%20Name%20of%20Love"&gt;In the Name of Love&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Chicko Jericho, &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; enom kang lair ing &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="3"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt; iki kalebu juru main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé katurunan &lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt; saka bapaké. Jenengé wiwit dikenal nalika main ing sinétron stripping “cinta bunga”. Ing sinétron iki, Chico akting bareng karo &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt; enom kang jenengé &lt;a href="Laudya%20Chintya%20Bella"&gt;Laudya Chintya Bella&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku Chico uga duwé katresnan karo lawan mainé ing sinétron iki saéngga Choco pacaran karo mantané &lt;a href="Raffi%20Ahmad"&gt;Raffi Ahmad&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="Laudya%20Chintya%20Bella"&gt;Laudya Chintya Bella&lt;/a&gt;.
Kariré diwiwiti nalika dadi ajang &lt;a href="Cover%20Boy"&gt;Cover Boy&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kalawarti"&gt;kalawarti&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Aneka%20Yess"&gt;Aneka Yess&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. Jenengé sangsaya misuwur nalika dadi bintang ing sinétron iki.
Chiko uga nyangka yèn dhèwèké dadi populèr kaya saiki. Nalika isih cilik Chico Jericho seneng ndeleng &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; lan akting. Chico njajal akting lan dhèwèké uga dadi seneng &lt;a href="akting"&gt;akting&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging nalika kudu ngapalaké &lt;a href="dhialog"&gt;dhialog&lt;/a&gt; utawa skrip &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;, Chico rada kangèlan, nanging Chico nganggep iki kanggo tantanngan supaya bisa luwih pinter &lt;a href="akting"&gt;akting&lt;/a&gt; manèh.
kulawarga Chico uga njurung kariré nanging Chico kudu tetep ngutamakaké &lt;a href="pandhidhikan"&gt;pandhidhikan&lt;/a&gt;.
Chico mesthi nganggo sandhangan modhis nanging kanggo sadina-dinané Chico mung nganggo &lt;a href="kaos"&gt;kaos&lt;/a&gt; oblong lan &lt;a href="clana"&gt;clana&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="jeans"&gt;jeans&lt;/a&gt;.
