Nadine Chadrawinata

Nadine Chandrawinata (#ALIH) ya iku &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia"&gt;Puteri Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun 2005 kang makili &lt;a href="Daerah%20Khusus%20Kutha%20krajan%20Jakarta"&gt;DKI Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;, Dhèwèké Putri Indonésia taun 2005 wakil saka provinsi DKI Jakarta.
Nadine duwé kasempatan makili Indonésia ning ajang Miss Universe taun 2006 kangdilaksanakaké ning &lt;a href="Shrine%20Auditorium"&gt;Shrine Auditorium&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;
